  "body": "`crates/geometry/src/geo2d.rs` is 766 lines. The 400-line file law in\nAGENTS.md asks for a split along the domain seams.\n\nA review of PR #2767 found the length. That PR did not change the length.\nIt changed 35 lines inside `merge_hole`.\n\nSplit the file so each part stays under about 400 lines. Candidate seams:\nthe region and loop types, the ear clipper and the hole bridge, and the\noffset and boolean helpers. Move the tests with the code. Keep the public\nAPI the same.\n\nCheck `cargo test -p camcraft-geometry --lib` and `--test geo2d` stay\ngreen, and `cargo clippy -p camcraft-geometry --all-targets -- -D\nwarnings` stays clean.\n",
